439	     * Transfer the person to the sheet {@code to}, returning their id there. They arrive with their first grade and every
440	     * grade given since (with its from-date), their terms (and those recorded since, with their from-dates), contact, tags and aliases, and their claims (listed in the order
441	     * they were, as the newest on that sheet) with their status, dates, notes, frozen figures, comments, lines and logs; a
442	     * claim in {@code numbers} takes the number given there, and each keeps the figure a statement bound it to; their
443	     * statements go with them. The references are not carried. They leave their sheet entirely: their claims, statements, holds, watches, plans, patron links, pool memberships
444	     * and closed-period figures are dropped with them.
